# Offline Settings arrangement save scenario. Run with a fresh TURNSTONE_ROOT;
# the verify twin must reuse the same root in a new Turnstone process.
settle 30
key escape
open mere://alpha
settle 30
act Open Settings pane
settle 10
assert pane turnstone.settings
click surface:settings role:button Edit arrangement
settle 2
click surface:settings role:button Add group
settle 2
click surface:settings role:button Save arrangement
settle 30
assert a11y Arrangement saved.
capture 01_settings_arrangement_saved
log Settings arrangement group saved
